            B.q("ai-m4-12", "ai-aks", "Which two probe settings fit? Select two.", listOf("A livenessProbe on /healthz, so the kubelet restarts the container when it stops answering", "A readinessProbe only, since it restarts the container", "No probes at all, so the container is never restarted", "A startupProbe that allows enough time for the model to load, so the liveness probe does not kill it during start-up"), setOf(0, 3), "A failing liveness probe restarts the container, which clears the deadlock. A startup probe holds the other probes back until it succeeds, so a slow start is not mistaken for a hang. A readiness probe only takes the pod out of the Service's endpoints; it never restarts anything.",
