            B.q("ai-m4-15", "ai-cosmos-sdk", "Latency is high and the API creates a new CosmosClient inside every request handler. What does Microsoft recommend?", listOf("Create one CosmosClient when the app starts and reuse it for the life of the process", "Create a new CosmosClient per query, but close it afterwards", "Create one CosmosClient per container per request", "Switch to the REST API and skip the SDK"), setOf(0), "CosmosClient is thread-safe and keeps connections, metadata caches and address information. Making a new one per request throws all of that away, so the guidance is one client (a singleton) per application.",
