            B.q("ai-m4-17", "ai-cosmos-perf", "Which two changes raise the RU charge of writing an item? Select two.", listOf("Making the item larger, for example adding a long text field", "Including more properties in the indexing policy", "Reading the x-ms-request-charge header after each write", "Using Session instead of Eventual consistency"), setOf(0, 1), "Write cost grows with item size and with the number of indexed paths that must be updated. Consistency mainly affects read cost, and reading the charge header is just measuring.",
