            B.q("ai-m4-20", "ai-cosmos-vector", "Searches must match both meaning and exact product codes such as 'XR-200'. Which query shape combines a keyword (full-text) score and a vector score into one ranking in Cosmos DB for NoSQL?", listOf("SELECT TOP 10 c.name FROM c ORDER BY RANK RRF(FullTextScore(c.description, 'XR-200'), VectorDistance(c.embedding, @q))", "SELECT TOP 10 c.name FROM c WHERE c.description = 'XR-200' ORDER BY c.embedding", "SELECT TOP 10 c.name FROM c ORDER BY VectorDistance(c.embedding, @q) + FullTextScore(c.description, 'XR-200')", "Two separate queries, then sort both lists by their raw scores"), setOf(0), "Hybrid search uses ORDER BY RANK with RRF (Reciprocal Rank Fusion), which merges the rankings from FullTextScore (keyword relevance) and VectorDistance (meaning). It needs a full-text policy and index plus the vector policy and index on the container.",
