            B.q("ai-m4-21", "ai-cosmos-vector", "Creating a container with a vector index fails in an existing database. The database was created with throughput shared by all its containers. What is the issue?", listOf("Vector indexes need Strong consistency, so raise the account's default level", "Vector search does not support shared throughput, so use dedicated throughput instead", "The partition key must be the vector path, so recreate it partitioned by /embedding", "Vector search is only in the API for MongoDB vCore, so move the data to that API"), setOf(1), "Microsoft lists shared throughput as a current limitation of vector indexing and search in Cosmos DB for NoSQL. Containers that use vector search need their own dedicated throughput.",
