            B.q("ai-m4-25", "ai-postgres", "You want to confirm whether a slow DELETE uses an index, with real timings, on production. What is the safe way?", listOf("Run EXPLAIN ANALYZE DELETE ... on its own", "Run BEGIN; EXPLAIN ANALYZE DELETE ...; ROLLBACK;", "Run EXPLAIN DELETE ... and read the estimated costs", "Run BEGIN; EXPLAIN ANALYZE DELETE ...; COMMIT;"), setOf(1), "EXPLAIN ANALYZE really executes the statement to measure it. Wrapping it in a transaction you roll back gives real timings and the plan without keeping the deletion. Plain EXPLAIN shows the plan without running it.",
